@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：可靠发送与 retry-component 内部协作

participant "DefaultReliableMessageSender" as Sender
participant "RetryPolicyRegistry" as PolicyRegistry
participant "RetryPolicy(message-send)" as Policy
participant "RetryExecutor" as Retry
participant "MessageSendRetryClassifier" as Classifier
participant "MessageProvider" as Provider

Sender -> PolicyRegistry: getRequired("message-send")
PolicyRegistry --> Sender: base RetryPolicy
Sender -> Sender: clone policy + replace classifier
Sender -> Retry: execute(RetryExecution<ProviderSendResult>)

loop attempt
  Retry -> Sender: operation.apply(RetryContext)
  Sender -> Provider: provider.send(request)
  Provider --> Sender: ProviderSendResult
  Sender --> Retry: ProviderSendResult
  Retry -> Classifier: classify(RetryAttempt)
  Classifier --> Retry: RetryDecision
  alt RETRY
    Retry -> Retry: backoff by policy
  else SUCCESS / STOP / ABORT
    Retry -> Retry: finish execution
  end
end

Retry --> Sender: RetryResult(status, attempts, failureCode)
Sender -> Sender: mapRetryResult -> SendResult

note over Sender,Classifier
retry-component 提供次数、时长、退避、监听和结果状态。
message-component 提供 MQ 发送语义分类器。
end note
@enduml
